Cell["\<\
The identity matrix has trace 2, so it is divided by its trace and read as \
the maximally mixed state, and a message is issued:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->458357744,ExpressionUUID->"6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"QuantumDistance", "[", 
